    "Learned. Learn them again if AutoHush gets them wrong." : {
      "comment" : "The menu's card and Settings → General, under “Controls”: the web app's controls (its Play/Pause button) are learned, and what to do if AutoHush gets them wrong; “Learn Again…” follows",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تم تعلّمها. أعد تعليمها إذا أخطأ فيها AutoHush."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apresos. Torna’ls a aprendre si l’AutoHush s’hi equivoca."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Naučeno. Pokud se AutoHush mýlí, naučte ho znovu."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lært. Lær den igen, hvis AutoHush tager fejl."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gelernt. Falls AutoHush sich irrt, erneut lernen."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Μαθεύτηκαν. Διδάξτε τα ξανά αν το AutoHush κάνει λάθος."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aprendidos. Vuelve a aprenderlos si AutoHush se equivoca con ellos."
