    "Until it has learned, AutoHush presses nothing on the page." : {
      "comment" : "The learning window, under the steps: until AutoHush has learned a web app's Play/Pause button, it presses none of the page's buttons (it pauses the web app once with the keyboard's Play/Pause key)",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يضغط AutoHush على أي شيء في الصفحة حتى يتعلّم."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fins que no ho ha après, l’AutoHush no prem res a la pàgina."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dokud se to nenaučí, AutoHush na stránce nic nemačká."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Indtil det har lært det, trykker AutoHush ikke på noget på siden."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bis es gelernt hat, drückt AutoHush nichts auf der Seite."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Μέχρι να μάθει, το AutoHush δεν πατά τίποτα στη σελίδα."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hasta que no lo haya aprendido, AutoHush no pulsa nada en la página."
